content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Student",
      "description": "Learner receiving tutoring support",
      "attributes": [
        "Availability",
        "Progress Record",
        "Tutor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Availability",
      "description": "Times when the student is free for tutoring"
    },
    {
      "name": "Progress Record",
      "description": "Notes on a student’s learning progress"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tutor",
      "description": "Instructor providing tutoring to the student"
    },
    {
      "name": "Subject",
      "description": "Topic the student wants to study"
    },
    {
      "name": "Homework Question",
      "description": "Student-submitted questions for the tutor"
    },
    {
      "name": "Parent",
      "description": "Guardian managing the student’s tutoring arrangements"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tutoring Package",
      "description": "Purchased bundle of tutoring sessions"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tutoring Session",
      "description": "Scheduled lesson between student and tutor",
      "attributes": [
        "Subject"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Academic Coordinator",
      "description": "Staff member managing tutor assignments and oversight"
    },
    {
      "name": "Learning Plan",
      "description": "Plan outlining learning goals and steps for the student"
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Tutoring Sessions": {
      "objects": [
        "Student",
        "Tutor",
        "Progress Record",
        "Subject",
        "Tutoring Session",
        "Homework Question"
      ]
    },
    "Organization": {
      "objects": [
        "Parent",
        "Academic Coordinator",
        "Student",
        "Availability",
        "Tutoring Package",
        "Learning Plan"
      ]
    },
    "subdomain connections": [
      "Tutoring Sessions--Organization"
    ]
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Tutoring Sessions": {
      "derived from": "Tutoring Sessions Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Student",
        "Tutor",
        "Progress Record",
        "Subject",
        "Tutoring Session",
        "Homework Question"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Organization": {
      "derived from": "Organization Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Parent",
        "Academic Coordinator",
        "Child",
        "Availability",
        "Tutoring Package",
        "Learning Plan"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Student -> Child"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
